<title>USA: Cache Nov same-store sales rise 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Cache Nov same-store sales rise 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $11.0	 $10.0	+10.0     +7.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date     $110.6	$103.5	 +7.0     -1.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage. The company said the November increase was due to strong sales of regular-priced goods, and that November 1995 sales included the Friday and Saturday following Thanksgiving.</p>
<p>    Month is	  four weeks ended Nov. 23.</p>
<p>Full company name is Cache Inc.</p>
